<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;">Hi {{name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Use this code to confirm your email before we open your Trialvo trial.
</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 20px;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:20px 16px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:#111827;">
      {{code}}
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  This code expires in {{minutes}} minutes.
</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;line-height:1.6;">
  If you did not request a Trialvo trial, you can ignore this email.
</p>
